<%- include('partials/header') %>

<div class="wrapper">
  <%- include('sidebar') %>

  <div class="container-services">
    <h2>How It Works</h2>
    <p>Our platform is designed to be user-friendly and efficient. Here's how you can make a difference:</p>
    <ol>
      <li><strong>Step 1:</strong> Browse through ongoing cases or report a missing or found person by clicking the "Lost Someone" or "Found Someone" buttons and filling out the forms.</li>
      <li><strong>Step 2:</strong> Share relevant details, descriptions, or images of the missing or found person to help raise awareness.</li>
      <li><strong>Step 3:</strong> Use our search functionality to find missing persons by name, location, or image.</li>
      <li><strong>Step 4:</strong> Stay connected with real-time updates, tips, and alerts about ongoing cases to help reunite families.</li>
      <li><strong>Step 5:</strong> Provide any tips, clues, or sightings that might aid in locating a missing person or identifying a found individual.</li>
    </ol>
    <p>By following these simple steps, you can actively contribute to helping locate missing persons and provide valuable support to families in distress.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<head>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles/services.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0-beta3/css/all.min.css">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
</head>

<style>
  /* General Styles */
 /* General Styles */
body {
  font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  background-color: #f4f6f9;
}

.wrapper {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  min-height: 100vh;
  width: 100%;
  max-width: 1200px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 15px;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

/* Services Container */
.container-services {
  border: 3px solid #d9534f;
  padding: 20px;
  margin: 15px 0;
  border-radius: 15px;
  background-color: #f8d7da;
  box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
  box-sizing: border-box;
  width: 100%;
}

.container-services h2 {
  color: #b30000;
  font-size: 1.8rem;
  font-weight: bold;
  margin-bottom: 15px;
  text-align: center;
}

.container-services p {
  font-size: 1rem;
  color: #721c24;
  line-height: 1.5;
  margin-bottom: 15px;
}

.container-services ol {
  list-style-type: none;
  padding-left: 0;
  margin: 0 0 20px 0;
}

.container-services ol li {
  margin-bottom: 15px;
  padding-left: 25px;
  position: relative;
  font-size: 1rem;
  color: #721c24;
  line-height: 1.5;
}

.container-services ol li::before {
  content: "✔";
  color: green;
  position: absolute;
  left: 0;
  font-weight: bold;
}

.container-services ol li strong {
  color: #d9534f;
}

/* Responsive Adjustments */
@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .wrapper {
    flex-direction: column; /* Stacking the sidebar and content vertically on smaller devices */
  }
  
  .container-services {
    margin-left: 0;
    padding: 25px;
  }
  
  .container-services h2 {
    font-size: 2rem;
  }
  
  .container-services p,
  .container-services ol li {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }
}

@media (min-width: 768px) and (max-width: 1024px) {
  .wrapper {
    flex-direction: column; /* Ensuring stacking for tablets */
  }

  .container-services {
    margin-left: 0;
    padding: 25px;
  }
  
  .container-services h2 {
    font-size: 2.2rem;
  }
  
  .container-services p,
  .container-services ol li {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
  }
}

@media (min-width: 992px) {
  .wrapper {
    flex-direction: row; /* Switching back to row on larger screens */
  }

  .container-services {
    padding: 35px;
  }
  
  .container-services h2 {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
  }
}

</style>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>